shit: 5:1: warning: A read without -r mangles a backslash in the input.
     5 |  read x < "$file"
       |  ^~~~~~
note: Add -r to read the line literally.
shit: 8:1: warning: A read without -r mangles a backslash in the input.
     8 |  read y < "$file"
       |  ^~~~~~
note: Add -r to read the line literally.
no_newline=[abc] 1
with_newline=[def] 0
